 449:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c **** /**
 450:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   * @brief  Configures the main PLL clock source, multiplication and division factors.
 451:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   * @note   This function must be used only when the main PLL is disabled.
 452:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *  
 453:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   * @param  RCC_PLLSource: specifies the PLL entry clock source.
 454:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *          This parameter can be one of the following values:
 455:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *            @arg RCC_PLLSource_HSI: HSI oscillator clock selected as PLL clock entry
 456:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *            @arg RCC_PLLSource_HSE: HSE oscillator clock selected as PLL clock entry
 457:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   * @note   This clock source (RCC_PLLSource) is common for the main PLL and PLLI2S.  
 458:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *  
 459:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   * @param  PLLM: specifies the division factor for PLL VCO input clock
 460:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *          This parameter must be a number between 0 and 63.
 461:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   * @note   You have to set the PLLM parameter correctly to ensure that the VCO input
 462:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *         frequency ranges from 1 to 2 MHz. It is recommended to select a frequency
 463:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *         of 2 MHz to limit PLL jitter.
 464:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *  
 465:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   * @param  PLLN: specifies the multiplication factor for PLL VCO output clock
 466:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *          This parameter must be a number between 50 and 432.
 467:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   * @note   You have to set the PLLN parameter correctly to ensure that the VCO
 468:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *         output frequency is between 100 and 432 MHz.
 469:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *   
 470:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   * @param  PLLP: specifies the division factor for main system clock (SYSCLK)
 471:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *          This parameter must be a number in the range {2, 4, 6, or 8}.
 472:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   * @note   You have to set the PLLP parameter correctly to not exceed 168 MHz on
 473:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *         the System clock frequency.
 474:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *  
 475:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   * @param  PLLQ: specifies the division factor for OTG FS, SDIO and RNG clocks
ARM GAS  /tmp/cc9hYLCi.s 			page 14


 476:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *          This parameter must be a number between 4 and 15.
 477:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *
 478:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   * @param  PLLR: specifies the division factor for I2S, SAI, SYSTEM, SPDIF in STM32F446xx devices
 479:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *          This parameter must be a number between 2 and 7.
 480:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *
 481:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   * @note   If the USB OTG FS is used in your application, you have to set the
 482:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *         PLLQ parameter correctly to have 48 MHz clock for the USB. However,
 483:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *         the SDIO and RNG need a frequency lower than or equal to 48 MHz to work
