1284:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c **** /**
1285:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   * @brief  Returns the frequencies of different on chip clocks; SYSCLK, HCLK, 
1286:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *         PCLK1 and PCLK2.
1287:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   * 
1288:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   * @note   The system frequency computed by this function is not the real 
ARM GAS  /tmp/cc9hYLCi.s 			page 37


1289:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *         frequency in the chip. It is calculated based on the predefined 
1290:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *         constant and the selected clock source:
1291:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   * @note     If SYSCLK source is HSI, function returns values based on HSI_VALUE(*)
1292:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   * @note     If SYSCLK source is HSE, function returns values based on HSE_VALUE(**)
1293:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   * @note     If SYSCLK source is PLL, function returns values based on HSE_VALUE(**) 
1294:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *           or HSI_VALUE(*) multiplied/divided by the PLL factors.         
1295:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   * @note     (*) HSI_VALUE is a constant defined in stm32f4xx.h file (default value
1296:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *               16 MHz) but the real value may vary depending on the variations
1297:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *               in voltage and temperature.
1298:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   * @note     (**) HSE_VALUE is a constant defined in stm32f4xx.h file (default value
1299:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *                25 MHz), user has to ensure that HSE_VALUE is same as the real
1300:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *                frequency of the crystal used. Otherwise, this function may
1301:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *                have wrong result.
1302:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *                
1303:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   * @note   The result of this function could be not correct when using fractional
1304:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *         value for HSE crystal.
1305:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *   
1306:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   * @param  RCC_Clocks: pointer to a RCC_ClocksTypeDef structure which will hold
1307:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *          the clocks frequencies.
1308:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *     
1309:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   * @note   This function can be used by the user application to compute the 
1310:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *         baudrate for the communication peripherals or configure other parameters.
1311:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   * @note   Each time SYSCLK, HCLK, PCLK1 and/or PCLK2 clock changes, this function
1312:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *         must be called to update the structure's field. Otherwise, any
1313:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *         configuration based on this function will be incorrect.
1314:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *    
1315:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   * @retval None
1316:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   */
