1444:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c **** /**
1445:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   * @brief  Configures the RTC clock (RTCCLK).
1446:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   * @note   As the RTC clock configuration bits are in the Backup domain and write
1447:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *         access is denied to this domain after reset, you have to enable write
1448:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *         access using PWR_BackupAccessCmd(ENABLE) function before to configure
1449:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *         the RTC clock source (to be done once after reset).    
1450:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   * @note   Once the RTC clock is configured it can't be changed unless the  
1451:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *         Backup domain is reset using RCC_BackupResetCmd() function, or by
1452:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *         a Power On Reset (POR).
1453:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *    
1454:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   * @param  RCC_RTCCLKSource: specifies the RTC clock source.
1455:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *          This parameter can be one of the following values:
1456:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *            @arg RCC_RTCCLKSource_LSE: LSE selected as RTC clock
1457:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *            @arg RCC_RTCCLKSource_LSI: LSI selected as RTC clock
1458:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *            @arg RCC_RTCCLKSource_HSE_Divx: HSE clock divided by x selected
1459:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *                                            as RTC clock, where x:[2,31]
1460:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *  
1461:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   * @note   If the LSE or LSI is used as RTC clock source, the RTC continues to
1462:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *         work in STOP and STANDBY modes, and can be used as wakeup source.
1463:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *         However, when the HSE clock is used as RTC clock source, the RTC
1464:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *         cannot be used in STOP and STANDBY modes.    
1465:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   * @note   The maximum input clock frequency for RTC is 1MHz (when using HSE as
1466:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *         RTC clock source).
1467:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   *  
1468:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   * @retval None
1469:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c ****   */
1470:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_rcc.c **** void RCC_RTCCLKConfig(uint32_t RCC_RTCCLKSource)
